            "review_title": "Review at Pop Lounge SteakHouse",
            "review_text": "Shin Nguyen\nSouth Australia, Australia26 contributions\n0\nPoorly done steak and overprice drink!!!\nJan 2019 • Couples\nRestaurant has a cozy with classic view, there is classical music as well to make the guests feel relax while waiting for food or eating.\nWe ordered spaghetti and T-bone steak, both of them are well-seasoned. The house also give 3 options of dipping sauce for the steak so you can choose depend on your reference.\nUnfortunately, the steak is cold and was done wrongly, we ordered medium steak but at the end we got well-done steak. The steak also look like pre-made.\nLastly, our lemonade soda was charged at 79,000vnd which I think super overprice for 1 can of soda with a little bit of sugar and a slice of lime.\nFood price is reasonable for such location and the decoration.\nRead more\nWritten January 10, 2019",
